<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry good, demand light. Sales confirmed for the week to date including late Friday and the weekend on 300 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none    last week -   400    last year -   800</p>
<p>Wk-to-date - 300    last week - 1,600    last year - 3,000</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
